<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT CENTRAL DISTRICTS BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT CENTRAL DISTRICTS BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>NAPIER, New Zealand 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat</p>
<p>Central Districts by six wickets in a day-night one-day cricket</p>
<p>match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Central Districts: 227 in 50 overs; Sri Lanka: 228</p>
<p>for four in 43.3 overs.</p>
</text>
